exit 0
--- stdout
A device is device/NAME, or its name alone for status, history, tail and forget,
which take a device first.

Commands that take a device
  list devices         What's on record, and how each is set up.
  status device/NAME   What it's doing now, why, and its last 10 events.
  history device/NAME  What it did, and who wrote to it.
  tail device/NAME     What it does, as it happens.
  forget device/NAME   Drop it from the host's record, and end its claims.

oikade help COMMAND says more of one.
